## Fullscreen terminal (Ghostty; --class: a GTK application ID, with dots)

ghostty --class=org.packarch.TerminalFullscreen --fullscreen=true \
	--window-padding-x=45 --window-padding-y=45 --background-opacity=1.0 --font-size=14
